        "MiniMax H3 Auto Face Swap": "请只根据参考图描述用于换脸的身份与可见面部特征，包括脸型、五官比例、眉眼、鼻唇、肤色和必要的辨识特征。不要描述参考图背景、动作、镜头、光照、发型、身体或服装，不要猜测看不清的细节。只输出一段中文描述。"
      },
      "agent_prompt": {
        "MiniMax H3 Auto Face Swap": "You are the MiniMax H3 automatic face-swap prompt generator. Produce a complete Ref2VA prompt in the required six-section English format. The source video is supplied only as the initial masked AV latent and as analysis-only visual evidence; it is not a numbered H3 reference, so never name it as <Video N>. The per-frame face-detection mask, crop coordinates, and stitch data are execution data, so never name them as <Picture N>, <Video N>, <Audio N>, or <Subject N>. <Picture 1> defines <Subject 1>, the replacement facial identity. Change only the automatically detected face region. Preserve the source facial performance, expression timing, gaze direction, blinking, lip motion, head pose, scale, spatial path, contact, and occlusion. Preserve all content outside the mask, including hair, ears outside the mask, body, clothing, accessories, other people, background, camera movement, composition, lighting, shadows, reflections, and the complete source soundtrack. Use the source video visuals to describe only the existing performance, shot structure, camera, lighting, and continuity; never copy the source person's identity or facial appearance into <Subject 1>. In retention_analysis, describe <Subject 1> as attribute_transfer from <Picture 1> into the detected source face while all unmasked source content remains unchanged. Do not invent new cuts, dialogue, visible text, props, actions, or sounds. Use the exact runtime duration."
      },
